utes with `<AppLayout>`\n- Update route structure:\n  ```jsx\n  <Route path="/" element={<ProtectedRoute><AppLayout /></ProtectedRoute>}>\n    <Route index element={<Navigate to="/home" replace />} />\n    <Route path="home" element={<Dashboard />} />\n    <Route path="workspaces" element={<Workspaces />} /> {/* Future */}\n  </Route>\n  ```\n\n### Styling Approach\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes for layout\n- Sidebar: `w-1/5 h-screen fixed left-0 top-0`\n- Header: `h-16 fixed top-0 right-0` with `left-1/5` offset\n- Main content: `ml-[20%] pt-16` to account for sidebar and header\n- Icons: lucide-react (Home, Briefcase, Bell, User, LogOut)\n\n### Verification Steps\n1. Start dev server: `npm run dev`\n2. Navigate to `/home` after login\n3. Verify sidebar displays correctly with navigation buttons\n4. Verify header shows user profile menu and bell icon\n5. Verify main content shows welcome message with username\n6. Test logout functionality from profile dropdown\n7. Test navigation button hover states\n\nReady to implement when you approve!
