2026-10-09 09:06:13.002 DEBUG icod.agent.runtime.loop: STEP 4: model responded ->\n  - text: Here is the complete report.\n\n---\n\n## Codebase Architecture Overview\n\n**Stack**: Express.js + Prisma (PostgreSQL) + JWT auth + express-validator\n**Pattern**: Module-based MVC — each module has `*.routes.js` → `*.controller.js` → `*.service.js`, all plain JS (no TypeScript).\n**Response convention**: All responses wrapped in `{ data: ..., count?: ... }`. Creates return `201`, deletes return `204`.\n**Error convention**: Every controller wraps in `try/catch` and calls `next(error)` to delegate to global error handler middleware.\n\n---\n\n## 1. AUTH MODULE (`backend/src/modules/auth/`)\n\n### Routes — `auth.routes.js`\n| Method | Path | Validation | Handler |\n|--------|------|-----------|---------|\n| POST | `/auth/register` | name required, email valid, password ≥6 chars | `register` |\n| POST | `/auth/login` | email valid, password required | `login` |\n| GET | `/auth/me` | `auth` middleware | `getMe` |\n\n### Controller — `auth.controller.js`\n- `register(req, res, next)` — extracts `{name, email, password}`, returns `{user, token}` (201)\n- `login(req, res, next)` — extracts `{email, password}`, returns `{user, token}`\n- `getMe(req, res, next)` — uses `req.user.id`, returns `{data: user}`\n\n### Service — `auth.service.js`\n- `register({name, email, password})` — checks duplicate email (BadRequestError), hashes with bcrypt (10 rounds), creates user, signs JWT (7d default)\n- `login({email, password})` — finds user, compares hash, throws 401 AppError on failure\n- `getMe(userId)` — returns user (selects id/name/email/createdAt), throws 404 if not found\n- `signToken(user)` — signs `{id, email}` with `JWT_SECRET`\n\n### Ownership Service — `ownership.service.js` (the authorization core)\nAll functions follow the same pattern: fetch the resource via Prisma, throw `NotFoundError` if missing, throw `ForbiddenError` if `userId` doesn't match the owner.\n\n- **`assertWorkspaceOwnership(workspaceId, userId)`** — checks `workspace.ownerId === userId` directly\n- **`assertSheetOwnership(sheetId, userId)`** — includes `workspace`, checks `sheet.workspace.ownerId === userId`\n- **`assertColumnOwnership(columnId, userId)`** — includes `sheet.workspace`, checks `column.sheet.workspace.ownerId === userId`\n- **`assertRowOwnership(rowId, userId)`** — includes `sheet.workspace`, checks `row.sheet.workspace.ownerId === userId`\n- **`assertFormOwnership(formId, userId)`** — includes `sheet.workspace`, checks `form.sheet.workspace.ownerId === userId`\n\n**Key design**: All ownership chains through `workspace.ownerId`. The app is single-owner, no teams/sharing.\n\n---\n\n## 2. WORKSPACES MODULE (`backend/src/modules/workspaces/`)\n\n### Routes — `workspaces.routes.js` (all under `router.use(auth)`)\n| Method | Path | Validation | Handler |\n|--------|------|-----------|---------|\n| POST | `/` | name required, trimmed | `create` |\n| GET | `/` | — | `list` |\n| GET | `/:id` | — | `getById` |\n| PUT | `/:id` | name required, trimmed | `update` |\n| DELETE | `/:id` | — | `remove` |\n\n### Controller — `workspaces.controller.js`\n- `create(req, res, next)` — passes `ownerId: req.user.id` to service\n- `list(req, res, next)` — calls `listByOwner(req.user.id)` — auto-scoped to user\n- `getById(req, res, next)` — `assertWorkspaceOwnership(id, req.user.id)` first\n- `update(req, res, next)` — `assertWorkspaceOwnership(id, req.user.id)` first\n- `remove(req, res, next)` — `assertWorkspaceOwnership(id, req.user.id)` first\n\n### Service — `workspaces.service.js`\n- `create({name, ownerId})` — `prisma.workspace.create`\n- `listByOwner(ownerId)` — `findMany` where `ownerId`, ordered by `createdAt desc`\n- `getById(id)` — `findUnique` with `include: { sheets: true }`\n- `update(id, {name})` — `update` name only\n- `remove(id)` — `delete`\n\n---\n\n## 3. SHEETS MODULE (`backend/src/modules/sheets/`)\n\n### Routes — `sheets.routes.js` (all under `router.use(auth)`)\n| Method | Path | Validation | Handler |\n|--------|------|-----------|---------|\n| POST | `/workspaces/:workspaceId/sheets` | name required | `create` |\n| GET | ... (+7859 chars)
